@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5168
@Veterinarios_DirectAddress = http://localhost:5170
@Token_Recepcionista = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_RECEPCIONISTA
@Token_Veterinario = REEMPLAZAR_CON_TOKEN_VETERINARIO

# ============================================================================
# 1. AUTENTICACIÓN POR EL GATEWAY (Ruta a: /gateway/auth/{everything} - Público)
# ============================================================================

### 1.1 Registrar cuenta Recepcionista - 201 Created (o 409 Conflict si ya existe)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "recepcion@vetcare.com",
  "clave": "Password123!"
}

### 1.2 Registrar cuenta Veterinario (luego ejecutar database/AsignarRolesUsuarios.sql) - 201 Created
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "veterinario@vetcare.com",
  "clave": "Password123!"
}

### 1.3 Login Recepcionista - 200 OK (copiar token a @Token_Recepcionista)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "recepcion@vetcare.com",
  "clave": "Password123!"
}

### 1.4 Login Veterinario - 200 OK (copiar token a @Token_Veterinario)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "veterinario@vetcare.com",
  "clave": "Password123!"
}

### 1.5 Login con credenciales inválidas - 401 Unauthorized
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "recepcion@vetcare.com",
  "clave": "ClaveIncorrecta"
}

### 1.6 Consultar perfil autenticado por el Gateway - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Recepcionista}}
Accept: application/json

# ============================================================================
# 2. CONSULTAS GET PÚBLICAS POR EL GATEWAY (Ruta b: Sin Token)
# ============================================================================

### 2.1 Listar propietarios sin token - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Obtener propietario por ID existente sin token - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios/1
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Obtener propietario inexistente - 404 Not Found
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios/9999
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Listar mascotas con filtros sin token - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas?especie=Perro&nombre=Bo
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Listar mascotas de un propietario sin token - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios/1/mascotas
Accept: application/json

# ============================================================================
# 3. ESCRITURA EN MICROSERVICIO 1 POR EL GATEWAY (Ruta c: Exige Token y Rol)
# ============================================================================

### 3.1 Intentar crear propietario SIN token - 401 Unauthorized (bloqueado por Ocelot Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Pedro",
  "apellidos": "Sin Token",
  "telefono": "999111222",
  "correo": "pedro.sintoken@correo.com"
}

### 3.2 Crear propietario con token de Recepcionista - 201 Created
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Recepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "María",
  "apellidos": "Gómez Vargas",
  "telefono": "999888777",
  "correo": "maria.gomez@correo.com"
}

### 3.3 Intentar crear propietario con token de Veterinario - 403 Forbidden (rol no autorizado en API)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/propietarios
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombres": "Intento",
  "apellidos": "Rol Veterinario",
  "telefono": "999000111",
  "correo": "intento.vet@correo.com"
}

### 3.4 Crear mascota con token de Recepcionista - 201 Created
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Recepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propietarioId": 1,
  "nombre": "Max",
  "especie": "Perro",
  "raza": "Poodle",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2023-02-10",
  "peso": 7.5,
  "numeroMicrochip": "MC-GW-001"
}

### 3.5 Intentar actualizar mascota con token de Recepcionista - 403 Forbidden
PUT {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Recepcionista}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propietarioId": 1,
  "nombre": "Bobby Intento Recepcion",
  "especie": "Perro",
  "raza": "Beagle",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2021-04-15",
  "peso": 13.0,
  "numeroMicrochip": "MC-100001"
}

### 3.6 Actualizar mascota con token de Veterinario - 204 No Content
PUT {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propietarioId": 1,
  "nombre": "Bobby Control Veterinario",
  "especie": "Perro",
  "raza": "Beagle",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2021-04-15",
  "peso": 13.2,
  "numeroMicrochip": "MC-100001"
}

### 3.7 Actualizar mascota inexistente con token de Veterinario - 404 Not Found
PUT {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propietarioId": 1,
  "nombre": "Inexistente",
  "especie": "Perro",
  "peso": 5.0,
  "numeroMicrochip": "MC-NO-9999"
}

### 3.8 Eliminar mascota con token de Veterinario - 204 No Content
DELETE {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/mascotas/3
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}

# ============================================================================
# 4. MICROSERVICIO 2 (VETERINARIOS EN MEMORIA) POR EL GATEWAY (Ruta d: Exige Token)
# ============================================================================

### 4.1 Consultar veterinarios por el Gateway SIN token - 401 Unauthorized
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/veterinarios
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Consultar lista de veterinarios por el Gateway CON token - 200 OK
# (NOTA: Si detienes VetCare.VeterinariosApi y ejecutas esta petición, el Gateway responderá 502 Bad Gateway)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/veterinarios
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Recepcionista}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 Consultar veterinario por ID existente (1) CON token - 200 OK
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/veterinarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Consultar veterinario por ID inexistente (9999) CON token - 404 Not Found
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/gateway/veterinarios/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{Token_Veterinario}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.5 Llamada DIRECTA al Microservicio 2 (:5170) SIN token - 401 Unauthorized
GET {{Veterinarios_DirectAddress}}/api/veterinarios
Accept: application/json

